<div class="mt-6 p-5 rounded-xl bg-white border border-neutral-200/90 shadow-xs">
  <h3 class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-neutral-900 mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
    <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
      <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path>
    </svg>
    Performance & Study Recommendations
  </h3>

  <!-- Smart Recommendation Banner -->
  <div class="p-3.5 rounded-lg bg-emerald-50/70 border border-emerald-200/80 mb-4 text-xs text-emerald-950">
    <span class="font-bold block text-emerald-900 mb-1">Key Strategy Insight:</span>
    <p id="analysis-recommendation-text" class="leading-relaxed">
      Fastest route to a 5: Earn just 2 more raw points on the DBQ. Each DBQ point adds +3.57 composite points, giving you the highest return on investment across the exam.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Multi-section Leverage Cards -->
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-xs">
    <div class="p-3 rounded-lg bg-neutral-50 border border-neutral-200/70">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between font-semibold text-neutral-800 mb-1">
        <span>Document-Based Question (DBQ)</span>
        <span class="text-blue-700 font-bold">+3.57 pts / raw pt</span>
      </div>
      <p class="text-neutral-500 text-[11px] leading-relaxed">
        Highest point leverage. Adding 1 outside evidence example or sourcing 1 more document can push you across a grade boundary.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="p-3 rounded-lg bg-neutral-50 border border-neutral-200/70">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between font-semibold text-neutral-800 mb-1">
        <span>Long Essay Question (LEQ)</span>
        <span class="text-blue-700 font-bold">+2.50 pts / raw pt</span>
      </div>
      <p class="text-neutral-500 text-[11px] leading-relaxed">
        Second highest leverage. Securing the contextualization and thesis points guarantees an automatic 2 / 6 base.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="p-3 rounded-lg bg-neutral-50 border border-neutral-200/70">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between font-semibold text-neutral-800 mb-1">
        <span>Short-Answer Questions (SAQ)</span>
        <span class="text-blue-700 font-bold">+2.22 pts / subpart</span>
      </div>
      <p class="text-neutral-500 text-[11px] leading-relaxed">
        9 total subparts. Mastering the ACE framework (Answer, Cite, Explain) takes under 12 minutes per prompt.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="p-3 rounded-lg bg-neutral-50 border border-neutral-200/70">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between font-semibold text-neutral-800 mb-1">
        <span>Multiple-Choice Questions (MCQ)</span>
        <span class="text-blue-700 font-bold">+0.73 pts / question</span>
      </div>
      <p class="text-neutral-500 text-[11px] leading-relaxed">
        40% of total score. Eliminating 2 distractor choices per stimulus gives you a baseline accuracy above 70%.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
